#import "/modern-iaf/manuals/layout/manual.typ": *

From the #term("Hangar") to the cockpit takes five steps. The jet's own start-up is in its manual (@manuals).

+ On the Hangar, select a jet under #scr("aircraft") (@hangar).
+ Select #scr("fly"). The #scr("missions") screen opens (@mission-list).
+ Select #scr("sec_training") for the lessons, or another section for a mission.
+ Select the mission. Its briefing opens (@briefing).
+ Select #scr("fly"). The loading screen runs (@loading) and you sit in the cockpit.

The briefing states the mission's objectives, and the #term("Notebook")'s checklist guides the flight (@notebook). Each mission ends in the #term("debrief") (@debrief). The lessons, in order, are in @lessons.
